<title>JAPAN: JGB futures end down on long liquidation.</title>
<headline>JGB futures end down on long liquidation.</headline>
<text>
<p>*JGB futures end down on long liquidation and profit-taking which emerged in last half-hour of trade.</p>
<p>*Investors' buying interest in cash JGBs still strong, especially at long-end of yield curve, traders said.</p>
<p>*Weaker yen and stronger stocks limited JGBs' upside.</p>
</text>
